# 正式协作仓库只跟踪协作机制、状态文件和同步包生成器。
# 原始研究、供应链原件、媒体、渲染物、线索库及本机配置保留在本地受控目录，
# 不因存在于此工作区而自动进入 Git。
/*
!/.gitignore
!/AGENTS.md
!/README.md
!/PROJECT_ENTRY.md
!/.env.example
!/Makefile
!/docker-compose.yml
!/docs/
!/docs/**
!/scripts/
!/scripts/build_project_sync_pack.py
!/scripts/validate_gpt_project_mechanism_sync.py
!/apps/
!/apps/**
!/core/
!/core/**
!/observability/
!/observability/**
!/modules/
!/modules/**
!/adapters/
!/adapters/**
!/workflows/
!/workflows/**
!/fixtures/
/fixtures/*
!/fixtures/README.md
!/fixtures/synthetic_metadata.json
!/fixtures/ingestion/
/fixtures/ingestion/*
!/fixtures/ingestion/synthetic_source_profiles.json
!/migrations/
!/migrations/**
!/tests/
!/tests/**
!/project_sync/
!/project_sync/PROJECT_SYNC_README.md
!/project_sync/PROJECT_SYNC_MANIFEST.json
!/project_sync/latest/
!/project_sync/latest/**
!/GPT项目资料同步包_gpt_project_mechanism_sync/
!/GPT项目资料同步包_gpt_project_mechanism_sync/**

# 无论目录规则如何，凭据与系统元数据始终不得提交。
.env
.env.*
!/.env.example
.DS_Store
._*
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
